Distributed release builds of FTransfer.app bundle the `cloudflared` binary
from Cloudflare, Inc., which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

    https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared

A copy of that licence ships inside the app bundle at
`FTransfer.app/Contents/Resources/cloudflared-LICENSE`, and is fetched by
`scripts/release.sh` at build time.

cloudflared is used unmodified, as a separate executable invoked by the app.
